        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Dowloads an encrypted C2 stager and links to the command server website.(I reported it). The payload contains Task Scheduler configuration code supplied with its own executable path, consistent with a persistence attempt. Reschedules itself every 30 mins (PT30M). It has evasion baked into the program using a rolling 4 key encryption of AES-128. it is a modular loader/backdoor with structured C2 tasking, persistence, and defense-evasion capabilities. Here is the configured command endpoint\tmopsikimilie[.]cc:406/TCP and the HTTP retrieval endpoint\tmopsikimilie[.]cc:408/TCP.\n"
